## Findings

- `DesignSettingsScreen` имеет 1 production call site и 1 preview call site: production рендерится из `AppShellScreen` для `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot`, preview находится в самом settings module (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:462`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:302`).
- Текущая app version цепочка прокидывает только `versionName`: `apps/android-next` задаёт `versionCode = 1` и `versionName = "0.1.0"`, но `MainActivity` передаёт в `AppShellScreen` только `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` (`apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`).
- `DesignSettingsScreen` сейчас получает только props/callbacks (`selectedStyle`, `onStyleSelected`, `modifier`) и не имеет observed Koin/repository/platform lookup в своей сигнатуре/import surface (`android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:49`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:50`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:51`).

## Components

### `DesignSettingsScreen`

- **Location**: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`
- **Description**: Compose screen for design settings; wraps content in `SchoolQuizDesignBackground` and renders a `LazyColumn` of header + design style options (`android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:53`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:58`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:63`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:66`).
- **Uses**: `SchoolQuizDesignStyle.entries` for rows and `onStyleSelected(style)` callback for selection (`android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:67`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:73`).
- **Used by**: `AppShellScreen` production route and `DesignSettingsScreenPreview` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:462`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:300`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:302`).
- **Data flow**: `selectedStyle` + `onStyleSelected` + `modifier` → `LazyColumn` rows → `DesignStyleOption` click calls `onStyleSelected(style)` (`android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:49`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:50`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:56`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:70`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:73`).

### `AppShellScreen`

- **Location**: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121`
- **Description**: Root shell Compose function; wires drawer/scaffold/top/bottom bars and per-tab child content (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:100`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:102`).
- **Uses**: Existing parameters include `appVersionName`, `isDebugBuild`, `selectedDesignStyle`, `onDesignStyleSelected`, `modifier` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:124`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:125`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:126`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:127`).
- **Used by**: `MainActivity` and `AppShellScreenTest` (`apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/AppShellScreenTest.kt:256`).
- **Data flow**: `appVersionName` goes to drawer only today via `DrawerContent(versionName = appVersionName)` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220`); `selectedDesignStyle` and `onDesignStyleSelected` go through `AppShellContent` → `LocalTabContent` → `DesignSettingsScreen` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:293`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:294`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:344`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:345`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:463`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:464`).

### `MainActivity`

- **Location**: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:24`
- **Description**: App entry Activity; creates `DefaultRootComponent` via Koin and calls `AppShellScreen` inside `SchoolQuizTheme` (`apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:30`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:40`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`).
- **Uses**: `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME`, `BuildConfig.DEBUG`, selected design style SharedPreferences (`apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:33`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:36`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:44`).
- **Used by**: Android runtime entry point class declaration (`apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:24`).
- **Data flow**: Gradle version metadata → generated app `BuildConfig` → `AppShellScreen(appVersionName = BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME)` (`apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:33`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:34`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`).

## Data flow

### Navigation to settings route

- Drawer settings section exists as `DrawerSection.LocalSection.Settings` and is always visible via `emptyMap()` (`shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/model/DrawerSection.kt:53`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/model/DrawerSection.kt:54`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/model/DrawerSection.kt:55`).
- Drawer item click calls `navigator.goTo(Destination.SelectSection(section))` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerSectionList.kt:37`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerSectionList.kt:39`).
- `NavigatorImpl.goTo` delegates to `RootComponent.onDestination(destination)` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/NavigatorImpl.kt:14`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/NavigatorImpl.kt:15`).
- `DefaultRootComponent.onDestination` calls `navigateUseCase(current, destination)` and `applyResult(current, result)` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:296`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:298`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:299`).
- `navigate` dispatches `Destination.SelectSection` to `onSelectSection` (`shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:73`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:77`).
- `DrawerSection.LocalSection.Settings` maps to `NavStack(LocalConfig.SettingsRoot)` (`shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:28`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:34`).
- `applyResult` syncs `new.localState.stack` into `localNavigation` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:393`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:399`).
- `DefaultLocalTabComponent` exposes `childStack: Value<ChildStack<LocalConfig, LocalScreenComponent>>` from `StackNavigation<LocalConfig>` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/tab/LocalTabComponent.kt:11`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/tab/LocalTabComponent.kt:12`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/tab/LocalTabComponent.kt:17`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/tab/LocalTabComponent.kt:20`).
- `AppShellContent` renders LOCAL children and delegates to `LocalTabContent` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:333`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:334`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:338`).
- `LocalTabContent` renders `DesignSettingsScreen` when `screen.config is LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:462`).

### Existing app version flow

- `apps/android-next` Gradle config defines `versionCode = 1` and `versionName = "0.1.0"` (`apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17`).
- `BuildConfig` generation is enabled in the app module (`apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:33`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:34`).
- `MainActivity` passes `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` as `appVersionName` to `AppShellScreen` (`apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`).
- `AppShellScreen` documents that library modules cannot access app `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` directly (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:107`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:108`).
- `AppShellScreen` passes `appVersionName` to `DrawerContent(versionName = appVersionName)` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:214`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220`).
- `DrawerContent` passes `versionName` to `DrawerFooter` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:31`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:70`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:73`).
- `DrawerFooter` displays `text = "v$versionName"` and wires click to `onVersionTap` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:73`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:74`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:79`).

## Entry Points

| Entry Point | Caller | Expected State | file:line |
|---|---|---|---|
| Drawer settings row tap | `DrawerSectionList` calls `navigator.goTo(Destination.SelectSection(section))` | `section` is one of `visibleSections(tab, userStats)` | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerSectionList.kt:29`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerSectionList.kt:39` |
| Navigation dispatcher | `NavigatorImpl.goTo` calls `RootComponent.onDestination` | `Destination.SelectSection` is accepted by `RootComponent.onDestination` | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/NavigatorImpl.kt:14`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/navigation/RootComponent.kt:24` |
| Domain transition | `navigate` dispatches to `onSelectSection` | `DrawerSection.LocalSection.Settings` maps to `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` | `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:77`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:34` |
| Decompose stack render | `Children(rootComponent.localTabComponent.childStack)` calls `LocalTabContent` | LOCAL tab child stack active config is rendered | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:334`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:338` |
| Settings route render | `LocalTabContent` branch for `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` | `selectedDesignStyle` and `onDesignStyleSelected` are available from `AppShellScreen` params | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:463`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:464` |
| Deep link path | `MainActivity.onNewIntent` calls `rootComponent.onDeepLink(DeepLink(uri))` for `schoolquiz://`; current `onDeepLink` is MVP stub | Deep link does not route to settings in current implementation | `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:55`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:59`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:313`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:314` |

## Impact Scan

| Consumer | Assumption | Impact | Severity |
|---|---|---|---|
| `DesignSettingsScreen` production call in `AppShellScreen` | Current call passes `selectedStyle`, `onStyleSelected`, `modifier` | Changing `DesignSettingsScreen` signature requires updating this call site | Compile-impacting: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:462`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:463`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:464`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:465` |
| `DesignSettingsScreenPreview` | Current preview passes `selectedStyle` and `onStyleSelected` only | Changing `DesignSettingsScreen` signature requires updating preview if new params have no defaults | Compile-impacting: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:302`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:303`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:304` |
| `AppShellScreen` app call | Current call passes `appVersionName = BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME`, no `versionCode` parameter exists in visible signature | Adding `appVersionCode` to `AppShellScreen` requires updating `MainActivity` | Compile-impacting: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:121`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43` |
| `AppShellScreenTest` | Current test call passes only `rootComponent` and `appVersionName` | Adding non-default `appVersionCode` to `AppShellScreen` requires updating this test call | Compile-impacting: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/AppShellScreenTest.kt:256`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/AppShellScreenTest.kt:257`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/AppShellScreenTest.kt:258` |
| `DrawerContent` / `DrawerFooter` | Current drawer API accepts `versionName` and `onVersionTap`; drawer version text is clickable | Settings footer must not reuse drawer `onVersionTap` if display-only behavior is preserved | Behavior-impacting: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:31`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt:32`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:45`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:79` |

## Duplicate Logic Scan

| Existing | Location | Similarity | Question |
|---|---|---|---|
| Drawer version label formatting | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:74` | Existing UI displays `v$versionName`; spec wants settings footer format `v<versionName> (<versionCode>)` | Reuse same visual convention `v...`, extend with code only in settings, or extract formatter? |
| App-layer version propagation comment | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:107`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:108` | Existing boundary already passes BuildConfig-derived version data from app layer into presentation | Extend `AppShellScreen` params with version code, or pass preformatted footer text? |
| Drawer `onVersionTap` dev-mode trigger | `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt:318`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:79` | Existing version label has interactive hidden behavior; settings spec says display-only | Keep settings footer separate from drawer tap callback? |

## Constraints / Risks / Open Questions

- `android:feature:local:settings:presentation` is a library module depending on designsystem/Compose, not on the app module (`android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:1`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:6`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:9`, `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/build.gradle.kts:10`).
- `android:feature:app-shell:presentation` depends on `android:feature:local:settings:presentation`, so `AppShellScreen` can call `DesignSettingsScreen` (`android/feature/app-shell/presentation/build.gradle.kts:10`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/build.gradle.kts:11`).
- `apps:android-next` depends on `android:feature:app-shell:presentation`, so app-layer BuildConfig values can enter app-shell only through app calls like `AppShellScreen(...)` (`apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:40`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:42`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`).
